Open an elevated 64-bit Windows PowerShell session as the same Windows account that will operate Hosangadi and run PM2. This is important because the application uses that account's `%USERPROFILE%`, Desktop, AppData and image directories. Do not elevate by supplying credentials for a different administrator account unless that different account will also run the application.

